    },
    "body": "The canonical current state still listed the authenticated restart as unimplemented. Record PR #1822’s checked source, the sealed zero-update native baseline and the running matched fits, with common-parent and development-data limits explicit.\n\nAlso record the independently reviewed fixed-map backward hypothesis and the conditional next decision; the active fits retain their frozen gradient policy and conditions.\n\nValidation at exact head: claim-wording script and git diff --check pass; independent draft evidence/mathematics review found no blocker. Documentation only. References #820.\n",
